  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On Myriad Year Flying Warship, Fang Yuan activates Myriad Beings Assimilation Transformation, then this move, then Leading Countless Stars. Fairy Zi Wei is running Heavenly Court’s transportation formation at the limit; she feels like she sits on a wild horse carriage that cannot stop, the formation self-detonates, starlight specks fade, and backlash leaves her near death and unconscious.",
      "chapters": [
        1937
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
