      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan explored Dragon Whale Paradise, he obtained the falling star rod tree from Shen Cong Sheng. Without that immemorial desolate plant, knowing of it would not let him transform into it; after obtaining it he observed and studied it and gained falling star rod tree transformation. The tree constantly attracts stars that fall into the trunk and become star marks. On Myriad Year Flying Warship he dispels the form and returns to human form.",
      "chapters": [
        1938
      ],
